  "title": "Protobuf: correct the wrong starting offsets of the field name and type tree items",
  "description": "The tvb starting offset of the generated field name and field type tree items are wrong, like:\n\n![bug_tvbrange](/uploads/2b02e0f19d60878c687a88f6ade43eb3/bug_tvbrange.jpg)\n\n\nThe correct offset like this:\n\n![real_bytes_tvbrange](/uploads/e63101c1c2860aa38a2d0ad6036bf905/real_bytes_tvbrange.jpg) \n\nThis bug is caused by the modification of the `*offset`.\n \n\nAfter fixing this bug:\n\n![correct_tvb_range](/uploads/a93b9cd58efccff6cf613c11d5654a12/correct_tvb_range.jpg)\n\n\n> You can get this sample capture file and configure Protobuf search path according to https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/wikis/grpc\n\nThis MR can be cherry-picking from master branch to 3.6 or 3.4 version branches.",
